What is a rock, paper, scissor game?. This game is being played by a user versus a computer. So if the User chooses rock
and the computer chooses paper, the computer will win, vice versa. If the user chooses paper and the computer chooses scissor,
the computer will win, vice versa. If the user chooses scissor and the computer chooses rock, the computer will win, vice versa.
If they choose the same thing, it will be a tier.

So in this game you'll first enter your name, and choose how many games you want to play, challenging a computer. Play that number
of games you want to play then you, then at the end you'll get a report.  
